# main-natural: the fixture of the natural bench (`--bench-natural`).
#
# The screen is the firmware's own main screen (the same keys as home-usb-20m,
# plus the natural knobs): what makes it the natural fixture is that the run
# drives the spectrum and the waterfall magnitudes frame by frame with the
# harness' deterministic generator, so the components invalidate themselves
# exactly as they do on the radio (spectrum every 1000/15 ms, one waterfall row
# every 1000/25 ms, the clock every 500 ms -- src/dsp.cpp, src/clock.c) instead
# of the full-screen repaint the forced bench fabricates.
#
# `natural_frames` is honoured only with `--bench-natural`/`--natural-frames`;
# like the `bench_*` knobs it never changes the rendered PNG, so this fixture is
# captured, inspected and compared like any other one. See tools/ui_harness/README.md.

name main-natural
screen main

seed 13

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx

natural_frames 40
